# Optional. Copy to `.env` -- which is gitignored -- and fill in.
#
# The study loop works with none of this set. DESIGN.md §10 is titled
# "Exchange protocol (no-API)" and means it: with no key, the briefing goes to
# the clipboard and the reply comes back through the paste box, which is the
# protocol. A key only removes the carrying.

# Any one of these is read, in this order:
#   STUDY_RELAY_KEY, aistudioAPI, GEMINI_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY
STUDY_RELAY_KEY=

# Optional overrides.
# STUDY_RELAY_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
# STUDY_RELAY_TIMEOUT=120
# STUDY_RELAY_ENDPOINT=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta

# The same variables both front ends already read, if you would rather keep
# them here than in your shell profile.
# STUDY_PRODUCT=products/<pack>
# STUDY_DB=study.db
# STUDY_LEARNER=me
